      }
    },
    "This manual covers the interface and basic operations of the Registry Manager: viewing the current registry of each package manager and switching it to a preset mirror.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This manual covers the interface and basic operations of the Registry Manager: viewing the current registry of each package manager and switching it to a preset mirror."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本手册介绍注册表管理器的界面与基本操作:查看各包管理器的当前镜像源,并切换到预设镜像源。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本手冊介紹註冊表管理器的介面與基本操作:檢視各套件管理器的目前鏡像來源,並切換到預設鏡像來源。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
